    "detailed_description": "Continue the Gone Upstate journey, now with your friends, further west into Big Sky Country. Settle the new land by collecting resources and building a base to support a persistent lifestyle on the modern frontier.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Big Sky Country</h2>Completely rebuilt from the ground up in the latest Unreal Engine 5 to support multiplayer, smoother gameplay and advanced AI.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive</h2>Maintain health, hunger, thirst and cold through crafting, farming and building.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft</h2>Craft tools for efficient resource collection, buildings to keep warm and your items safe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defend</h2>Mysterious entities from the sky will begin to notice the new settlement. Arriving in unidentified flying objects, defend your base with crafted weapons, guns and traps. Shoot your way through and gain the right to survive!",
